just1nlee.com
=============

My personal website. It contains features like EN to KOR language translation, as well as a little monkey riding a cloud that you can play with.

I wanted to create a place to express myself and finally make use of the just1nlee.com domain name I bought. I also wanted to use this site as an exercise to refresh my web development skills. Everything you can see and interact with was written with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, without the use of any frameworks. I created the pixel art sprites and animations in Aseprite. The monkey sprite is based on original art by apple jelly, used with their permission: https://www.reddit.com/r/PixelArt/comments/lrusgr/monkey/
